IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `types`

§ `Chapter 4 -- General exceptions`

-- Penal Code 1871 ss 6, 76, 79A, 82, 83, 84, 95.
-- Every definition of an offence is understood subject to these exceptions (s 6).
-- Source: registers/source-bundle/PC1871.txt.

§§ `Section 76 -- Bound or justified by law`

@ref "Penal Code 1871, s 76"
GIVEN a IS A `Proposed Act`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `section 76 applies` IF
    a's `bound by law to do it or justified by law in doing it`

§§ `Section 79A -- Mistake of law is not a defence`

@ref "Penal Code 1871, s 79A(1)"
GIVEN a IS A `Proposed Act`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `mistake of law is a defence` IF
    FALSE

§§ `Section 82 -- Child below 10`

@ref "Penal Code 1871, s 82"
GIVEN a IS A `Proposed Act`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `section 82 applies` IF
    (a's `actor`)'s `age in years` BELOW 10

§§ `Section 83 -- Child of or above 10 and below 12 without sufficient maturity`

@ref "Penal Code 1871, s 83"
GIVEN a IS A `Proposed Act`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `section 83 applies` IF
        (a's `actor`)'s `age in years` AT LEAST 10
    AND (a's `actor`)'s `age in years` BELOW 12
    AND NOT (a's `actor`)'s `has sufficient maturity of understanding`

§§ `Section 84 -- Unsound mind`

-- Encoded only on the statutory opening words of s 84(1): nothing is an offence
-- which is done by a person who, at the time of doing it, by reason of
-- unsoundness of mind, is incapable... The remaining capacity tests of s 84
-- are not encoded (see NOTES.md).

@ref "Penal Code 1871, s 84(1)"
GIVEN a IS A `Proposed Act`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `section 84 applies` IF
    (a's `actor`)'s `is of unsound mind at the time of the act`

§§ `Section 95 -- Slight harm`

@ref "Penal Code 1871, s 95"
GIVEN a IS A `Proposed Act`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `section 95 applies` IF
    a's `harm is so slight that no person of ordinary sense and temper would complain`

§§ `A general exception applies`

@ref "Penal Code 1871, s 6"
@export Decide whether a Chapter 4 general exception encoded here means the act is not an offence
GIVEN a IS A `Proposed Act` @desc The proposed act. Set actor age in years, has sufficient maturity of understanding, is of unsound mind at the time of the act, bound by law to do it or justified by law in doing it, and harm is so slight that no person of ordinary sense and temper would complain.
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `a general exception applies` IF
        `section 76 applies` a
    OR  `section 82 applies` a
    OR  `section 83 applies` a
    OR  `section 84 applies` a
    OR  `section 95 applies` a

